<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Privacy Policy — SwiftShift</title>
<meta name="description" content="Privacy Policy for SwiftShift, a Neuhaus Apps product.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@700;800&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --background: oklch(16% .035 265);
    --foreground: oklch(97% .005 250);
    --card: oklch(21% .035 265);
    --muted-foreground: oklch(72% .028 254);
    --border: oklch(100% 0 0/.12);
    --surface: oklch(100% 0 0/.04);
    --primary: oklch(62% .212 259);
    --primary-foreground: oklch(99% .002 250);
    --accent: oklch(69% .18 46);
    --glow-blue: 0 0 90px -20px oklch(62% .212 259/.55);
    --glow-orange: 0 0 90px -24px oklch(69% .18 46/.45);
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  html, body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    background: var(--background);
    color: var(--foreground);
    font-family: 'Manrope', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  a { color: inherit; }

  .font-display {
    font-family: 'Archivo', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  header {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 50;
    width: 100%;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--background) 80%, transparent);
    backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
  }

  .header-inner {
    margin: 0 auto;
    max-width: 80rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .header-inner { padding: 0.75rem 2rem; }
  }

  .brand {
    display: flex;
    min-width: 0;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .brand img {
    height: 2.5rem;
    width: 2.5rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border-radius: 0.7rem;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px -8px var(--primary);
  }

  .brand span {
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--foreground);
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-height: 2.75rem;
    align-items: center;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface);
    padding: 0 1.25rem;
    font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .back-link:hover { color: var(--foreground); }

  main {
    margin: 0 auto;
    max-width: 48rem;
    padding: 4rem 1.25rem 5rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    main { padding: 5.5rem 2rem 6rem; }
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-size: 2.75rem;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }

  h1 .accent { color: var(--primary); }

  .updated {
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin: 0 0 3rem;
  }

  .lede {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--foreground);
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    box-shadow: var(--glow-blue);
  }

  section { margin-bottom: 2.75rem; }

  h2 {
    font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  h2::before {
    content: "";
    display: inline-block;
    width: 0.5rem;
    height: 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: var(--glow-orange);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  p { color: var(--foreground); margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  p.muted { color: var(--muted-foreground); }

  ul { margin: 0 0 1rem; padding-left: 1.25rem; }
  li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--foreground); }
  li::marker { color: var(--primary); }

  .fact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .fact-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }

  .fact {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface);
    border-radius: 0.875rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
  }
  .fact strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
  .fact span { color: var(--muted-foreground); font-size: 0.9rem; }

  code {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 0.35rem;
    padding: 0.1rem 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.85em;
  }

  footer {
    border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--border) 60%, transparent);
    padding: 3.5rem 0;
  }

  .footer-inner {
    margin: 0 auto;
    max-width: 80rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding: 0 1.25rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .footer-inner {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 0 2rem;
    }
  }

  .footer-brand {
    display: flex;
    min-width: 0;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .footer-brand img {
    height: 2.75rem;
    width: 2.75rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
  }
  .footer-brand p { margin: 0; }
  .footer-brand .name {
    font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--foreground);
  }
  .footer-brand .tagline {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }

  footer nav ul {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) { footer nav ul { justify-content: flex-end; } }
  footer nav a {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-height: 2.75rem;
    align-items: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  footer nav a:hover { color: var(--foreground); }

  .copyright {
    margin: 2rem auto 0;
    max-width: 80rem;
    padding: 0 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--muted-foreground) 70%, transparent);
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) { .copyright { padding: 0 2rem; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="header-inner">
    <a href="https://neuhausapps.com/swiftshift" class="brand">
      <img src="icon.png" alt="SwiftShift app icon">
      <span class="font-display">SwiftShift</span>
    </a>
    <a href="https://neuhausapps.com/swiftshift" class="back-link">Back to SwiftShift</a>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
  <h1>Privacy <span class="accent">Policy.</span></h1>
  <p class="updated">Last updated: July 31, 2026</p>

  <div class="lede">
    SwiftShift is built to compare job offers without asking anything of you in return.
    There is no account, no sign-up, and no data collection. Everything you enter stays
    on your device.
  </div>

  <div class="fact-grid">
    <div class="fact"><strong>No account required</strong><span>Use the app immediately — nothing to sign up for.</span></div>
    <div class="fact"><strong>No internet required</strong><span>Comparisons are calculated entirely on your device.</span></div>
    <div class="fact"><strong>No data leaves your device</strong><span>We don't have servers that store your offer details.</span></div>
    <div class="fact"><strong>No analytics or tracking</strong><span>No third-party SDKs, ads, or usage tracking of any kind.</span></div>
  </div>

  <section>
    <h2>What SwiftShift Does</h2>
    <p>
      SwiftShift helps you compare two job offers — pay, schedule, paid time off, benefits,
      and commute — to see which one is worth more in practice, not just on paper. You enter
      details about each offer, and the app calculates an estimated comparison locally, on
      your device.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p><strong>None.</strong> SwiftShift does not collect, transmit, or have access to any
      information you enter into the app. There are no SwiftShift servers that receive your
      offer details, and the app does not require you to create an account or provide any
      personal information to use it.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Where Your Data Lives</h2>
    <p>
      The offers you enter — employer names, pay, schedule, PTO, benefits, and commute
      details — are saved only in local storage on your own device. This data is never
      transmitted anywhere. If you delete the app, that data is deleted with it. SwiftShift
      has no mechanism to back this data up to a server, sync it across devices, or share
      it with us or anyone else.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>App Store Review Prompts</h2>
    <p>
      SwiftShift may occasionally ask iOS to show Apple's native "Ask to Rate" prompt,
      using Apple's own <code>StoreReview</code> API. This is entirely handled by Apple at
      the operating system level — SwiftShift does not receive any information about
      whether you rated the app, and no data about this interaction is sent to us.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Analytics, Advertising &amp; Third Parties</h2>
    <p>
      SwiftShift does not integrate any analytics, advertising, or crash-reporting SDKs,
      and does not share data with third parties, because it does not collect any data to
      share in the first place.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      SwiftShift does not knowingly collect information from anyone, including children
      under 13, because it does not collect information from anyone at all.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
      If SwiftShift's data practices ever change — for example, if a future version adds an
      optional account or cloud sync — this page will be updated first, and the "Last
      updated" date above will reflect the change.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy can be sent through
      <a href="https://neuhausapps.com/support" style="color: var(--primary); text-decoration: underline;">neuhausapps.com/support</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <img src="icon.png" alt="SwiftShift app icon">
      <p>
        <span class="name">SwiftShift</span><br>
        <span class="tagline">A Neuhaus Apps product</span>
      </p>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Footer">
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://neuhausapps.com">Back to Neuhaus Apps</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://neuhausapps.com/swiftshift/privacy">Privacy Policy</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://neuhausapps.com/swiftshift/terms">Terms of Use</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://neuhausapps.com/support">Support</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </div>
  <p class="copyright">© 2026 Neuhaus Apps. SwiftShift is not yet available on the App Store.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
